{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dv919wKQEW1794324960.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國有參議員近日率團訪問台灣之際，外長王毅敦促法方恪守一個中國原則。</p><p></p><p>王毅周二應約同法國外長巴羅通電話。</p><p></p><p>王毅稱，保持中法關係健康穩定發展，符合兩國和國際社會利益，雙方應落實兩國元首共識，希望法方以實際行動，恪守一個中國原則，維護好中法關係政治基礎。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FRA-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gQnn8KlwAD1794324971.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>王毅稱，中歐合則兩利、鬥則俱傷，期待歐方同中方相向而行，共同打造穩定、平衡的中歐貿易夥伴關係，相信法國作為歐盟核心大國，將為此發揮建設性作用。</p><p></p><p>外交部指，巴羅稱法國始終高度重視中國大國地位，恪守一個中國政策，希望同中方保持高層互動，深化戰略互信。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.563014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.605430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:25.844065+00:00","content_hash":"8b65f0d9c36e9f2e58c5db337f8f64902d4bf4cef0fd5f78c195cb8d071a1a39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.563014+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}